m categories that are shown in a category tree view in the `GridMap` editor:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"840\" height=\"380\" alt=\"gridmap_categories\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44239e5d-35f7-4bb2-9ac0-da0bc8426d15\" />\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n- `MeshLibrary` items have a new property called `category`, which can be used create categories (and sub categories using `/` as a delimiter).\r\n- In the `GridMap` editor, a tree will show up if any categories are found. Category names will be taken into account when filtering items.\r\n\r\n- ~The delimiter for sub categories can be set with `MeshLibrary.category_delimiter`, with options for slashes, compound words, and snake case.~\r\n- ~Categories can be created automatically if `MeshLibrary.categorize_by_name` is enabled.~\r\n- ~When exporting a scene to a `MeshLibrary`, it will autofill item categories if the `MeshInstance3D`s contain the metadata \"category\" with a `String` value.~\r\n\r\nSee discussion below.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"http